@startuml
title SysMon - Compute Group State Diagram

[*] --> Drafting : Admin opens Create New Compute Group

state Drafting
state Active
state Updating
state DeletionPending
state Deleted

Drafting --> Drafting : setLimits(cpu, ram, gpu)\n/ reject if exceeding host
Drafting --> Active : createGroup()\nlimits validated
Drafting --> [*] : Admin cancels creation

Active --> Updating : modifyGroup() selected
Active --> DeletionPending : deleteGroup() requested

Updating --> Updating : setLimits(cpu, ram, gpu)\n/ reject if exceeding host
Updating --> Active : applyChanges()\nconfiguration accepted
Updating --> Active : Admin cancels modification

DeletionPending --> Active : Admin cancels
DeletionPending --> Active : groupStillInUse()\n/ deletion rejected
DeletionPending --> Deleted : confirmDelete()\ngroup unused

Deleted --> [*]

note right of Active
  Key business object for
  resource governance (US1).
  Methods: createGroup,
  modifyGroup, deleteGroup,
  setLimits, groupStillInUse,
  applyChanges, confirmDelete.
  Consumed by container deploy
  and LLM spawn as argument
  (assigned Compute Group).
end note

@enduml
